<div class="tools_dices_show_page">
  <%= content_for :title, "diceNdM (サイコロ)" %>
  <%= render TitleComponent.new(title: "diceNdM (サイコロ)") %>
  <section>
    サイコロを振るツールです。個数と面の数を入力してください。<br>
    一般的な立方体のサイコロを1つ振る場合は1d6となります。
  </section>

  <section>
    <%= form_with model: @dice, url: tools_dice_path, local: true, class: "form" do |form| %>
      <%= form.number_field :number, placeholder: "個数", class: "number_field right" %>
      <span class="d">d</span>
      <%= form.number_field :side, placeholder: "面の数", class: "number_field" %>
      <%= form.submit "振る", class: "submit" %>
    <% end %>
  </section>
</div>
